WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.600
F1.2 · A tour of the interface

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.350
The interface has four fixed areas.

3
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.600
Tabs, left panel, top bar, and the bell.

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.850
Click a tab to switch workspace.

5
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.600
Pointing at it does nothing; the left panel follows the tab.

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.850
The top bar filters what you see.

7
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:29.600
The same selectors apply in FP&A and in Cash.

8
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.850
Sync all refreshes every connected source, one after the other.

9
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.600
Its progress shows in the button; the detail goes to the bell.

10
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.850
Every page has a back button, and every dialog is a K-φ dialog.

11
00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:45.600
If something is unreadable in either theme, report it.

12
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:50.600
Next: F1.3  Tenants, entities and reporting axes

